		title = "The Five Fingers",
		text = "\"Syndicate\" is the City's word for any gang with a name. The Five Fingers are the five biggest Syndicates in the Backstreets, so powerful that even Wings and Associations avoid picking fights with them. Each Finger is built around a virtue: the Thumb around propriety, the Index around faith, the Middle around loyalty, the Ring around art and knowledge, the Pinky around humanity.\n\nThe Fingers have branches in every region, and their rules are much the same everywhere. Backstreets children learn them early: pay what's owed, mind your manners, and never anger anyone carrying a book of grudges.",
