		category = "fingers",
		title = "The Thumb's Ladder",
		text = "In the Thumb, rank is everything. A recruit starts as a Soldato Primo, then Secondo, Terzo and Quarto. Above the Soldati are the Capi, graded I to IIII, and above them the Sottocapo, the underboss who runs an area. At the very top is the Capo dei capi, whom members call the Padrino.\n\nEvery rank has rules: when you eat, where you stand, how low you bow. A Soldato must not stare into a superior's face, or say a Capo's name without the proper title. The rules fill an introductory manual more than a thousand pages long.\n\nThumb fighters carry guns loaded with propellant rounds. Bullets are expensive, so a Soldato thinks before shooting. Disrespect, even one wrong word, is punished.",
