		text = "The Middle is a family. Members call each other Little Brother and Little Sister, Big Brother and Big Sister, and above those stand the Great Brothers and Great Sisters. A Big Sibling who wants that title must first make a long Pilgrimage of Loyalty. Their tattoos mark them on sight, and they treat each other as real kin.\n\nThe Middle's creed is simple. The Middle remembers. And the Middle always pays its debts, in whichever form. A favor is repaid. So is a slight.",
