		text = "The Middle writes its grudges in a Book of Vengeance. A Big Sibling carries one: a heavy old book, often chained at the waist. It is organized like a law code, in Titles, Sections, Rows and Lines, each listing an offense and its punishment.\n\nOnce your name is in the Book, the Middle will come for you, however long it takes. Its revenge can fall on one person or on a whole neighborhood. Getting a name struck out takes favors, money, and someone the Middle respects. It has been done. Not often.",
