		id = "fn_lore_index",
		category = "fingers",
		title = "Proselytes and Proxies",
		text = "New members of the Index are called Proselytes. Each trains under a Proxy, one of the Finger's trusted fighters, and carries out Prescripts written on paper slips. Senior members receive their Prescripts on a device instead. Messengers carry the slips to the people they are meant for.\n\nNobody outside knows who writes the Prescripts, and members don't ask. A Prescript is followed exactly, however strange: buy three oranges, stand on the bridge at 4:12, give your umbrella to the second person who sneezes. People who obey feel something like grace. People who don't, the Index says, carry the consequences.",
