		text = "The Ring is devoted to art and knowledge, pursued well past the point where other people would stop. It is divided into schools with their own ideas of beauty: the Pointillists, the Fauvists (who have splits of their own), and the Corporists, who build life-sized mannequins called Automanikins.\n\nA member starts as a Student and can become a Docent, whose rank shows in the shape of their ring. A Maestro is someone who has founded a movement of their own. The schools keep galleries, open by invitation. Visitors call the art unforgettable, and they don't mean it kindly.",
