		title = "Big Brother Oswin",
		secret = true,
		text = "Oswin is a Big Brother of the Middle from the South. He wears sunglasses in any weather, Middle tattoos climb out of his collar, and his Book of Vengeance hangs from his waist on a chain. He is supremely sure of himself, playful in a fight, and very vain about his hair. He will explain, at length, that the world is divided into the luscious and the bristly.\n\nOn the Great Lake, a group of strangers emptied his personal safe, the one with the kitty stickers. In it was a coupon for five hours of personal hair care from the director of the finest salon on the Stingray Portship. Title 8, Section 20, Row A, Line 6 of his Book covers stolen salon coupons. The punishment is complete and total extermination of everyone involved.\n\nThe Indigo Elder, a Color Fixer, wounded him with a single thrown harpoon and sent him off the Lake. Later Oswin chased the thieves all the way to Hongyuan in District 8, held out against the Sweepers' waves, and was launched into the skyline by a shifting building, swearing that this was also going in the books.",
